        "content": "{\n  \"analysis\": \"QEMU 5.2.0 binary cannot run due to Rosetta syscall incompatibility. QEMU 8.2.2 runs but the VM is stuck at EIP=0x5f1 in BIOS code. We have the QEMU 5.2.0 SeaBIOS files available. We should try QEMU 8.2.2 with explicit 5.2.0 BIOS, TCG acceleration, and 5.2 machine type to see if the older firmware resolves the boot issue.\",\n  \"plan\": \"Kill the current QEMU, relaunch QEMU 8.2.2 with the 5.2.0 BIOS explicitly via -bios, the 5.2.0 pc-bios directory via -L, TCG acceleration, and the 5.2 machine type. Wait 15 seconds, then check if the CPU is advancing by sampling registers twice. Take a VNC screenshot to check for boot progress.\",\n  \"commands\": [\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"kill $(cat /tmp/qemu.pid 2>/dev/null) 2>/dev/null || true; sleep 1; rm -f /tmp/qemu-monitor.sock /tmp/qemu.pid\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 2.0\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"qemu-system-i386 \\\\\\n  -accel tcg \\\\\\n  -machine pc-i440fx-5.2 \\\\\\n  -bios /tmp/qemu-5.2.0/pc-bios/bios.bin \\\\\\n  -L /tmp/qemu-5.2.0/pc-bios \\\\\\n  -drive file=/app/isos/win311.img,format=raw,snapshot=on \\\\\\n  -m 64 \\\\\\n  -rtc base=localtime \\\\\\n  -vnc 0.0.0.0:1 \\\\\\n  -chardev socket,id=mon0,path=/tmp/qemu-monitor.sock,server=on,wait=off \\\\\\n  -mon chardev=mon0,mode=readline \\\\\\n  -daemonize \\\\\\n  -pidfile /tmp/qemu.pid\\necho \\\"Exit: $?\\\"\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 2.0\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"sleep 15\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 15.0\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"python3 << 'EOF'\\nimport socket, time\\ns = socket.socket(socket.AF_UNIX, socket.SOCK_STREAM)\\ns.connect(\\\"/tmp/qemu-monitor.sock\\\")\\ntime.sleep(0.3)\\ns.recv(4096)\\ns.send(b\\\"info status\\\\n\\\")\\ntime.sleep(0.5)\\nprint(s.recv(4096).decode())\\ns.send(b\\\"info registers\\\\n\\\")\\ntime.sleep(0.5)\\nr1 = s.recv(4096).decode()\\nprint(r1)\\ntime.sleep(2)\\ns.send(b\\\"info registers\\\\n\\\")\\ntime.sleep(0.5)\\nr2 = s.recv(4096).decode()\\nprint(r2)\\nprint(\\\"CPU advancing:\\\", r1 != r2)\\ns.close()\\nEOF\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 3.0\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"vncsnapshot -allowblank localhost:1 /tmp/vnc-test3.jpg 2>&1 || true\\npython3 -c \\\"from PIL import Image; img=Image.open('/tmp/vnc-test3.jpg'); print('Size:', img.size); colors=img.getcolors(maxcolors=100000); print('Colors:', len(colors) if colors else '>100000'); print('Top:', sorted(colors, key=lambda x:-x[0])[:15] if colors else 'N/A')\\\"\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 1.0\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"ss -ltnp | grep -E ':5901|:6080|:80 '\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 0.5\n    }\n  ]\n}",
